<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile makes no chromite ore sale.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile makes no chromite ore sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold no metallurgical grade chromite ore following the May 13 bid opening.</p>
<p>The next receipt of bids will be on June 10.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
